Package: journalfig
Title: Schisler Lab Journal Figure Pipeline
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Schisler", email = "schisler@unc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds manuscript figures at final print size with live text, so
    Illustrator can assemble and annotate them without re-rendering. Encodes the
    lab's type, geometry and export conventions, and enforces them by reopening
    the exported files and checking rather than by asking anyone to remember.
